# 开发规范 Development Standards

## 1. 代码注释规范 Code Comments

在主要逻辑处必须添加简短的英文注释：

### 要求 Requirements

- ✅ 在关键算法、复杂逻辑处添加英文注释
- ✅ 在函数/方法的开头说明其目的
- ✅ 在条件分支处说明判断原因
- ✅ 注释要简洁，通常不超过一行

### 示例 Examples

```dart
// ✅ GOOD - 简短清晰的英文注释
// Validate user input before submission
if (_formKey.currentState!.validate()) {
  // Navigate to home screen after successful login
  context.go('/home');
}

// ✅ GOOD - 说明复杂逻辑的目的
// Calculate weighted average with decay factor
// to prioritize recent user interactions
final score = interactions.fold<double>(
  0,
  (sum, interaction) => sum + interaction.weight * interaction.value,
) / totalWeight;
```

```kotlin
// ✅ GOOD
// Check if user has premium subscription
if (user.isPremium) {
  // Unlock all features for premium users
  unlockAllFeatures()
}
```

